# Mic + Galaxy screen recording (HARD)

User 2026-08-25 (rt5): **AEC + noise suppression + auto gain on** — never raw-first.

## Contract

| Piece | Behavior |
|-------|----------|
| Capture | WebRTC (`echoCancellation/noiseSuppression/autoGainControl: true`) |
| Fallback | `{ audio: true }` only (no raw-first) |
| Stream | One `sharedMicManager` fan-out — no duplicate `getUserMedia` |
| XR | Mic **stays open** |
| Suspend | Visemes only — never `track.stop()` |

## Forbidden regressions

- Raw-first (all DSP off) — avatar hears itself
- Releasing the mic on XR enter

## Source of truth

- Studio: `micConstraints.js` + `sharedMicManager.js`
- Companion: `chat/app/src/personaplex/mic-constraints.ts`
